        <mxCell id="login-decisions-copy" value="• One centred 580 px card; no decorative split panel.&#10;• Segmented Sign in / Register control remains visible in both modes.&#10;• Errors remain inside the card and never depend on transient toast-only feedback.&#10;• No social login is represented; adding it requires a Draw.io-first change." style="text=;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#4F554D;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;letterSpacing=0;locked=1;" vertex="1" parent="1" bloghubSection="login-auth-lifecycle">
